# cards: the first won battle against a species gives its card (docs/plan-cards.md 2.6, point 7). First temple
# battle (Bealzebubs, a Thanatos, ...), party2_strong, A pressed through the fight and the results. Expect: at the end,
# the Bealzebub card (227, bag 0x0213BA12) and the Thanatos card (246, bag 0x0213BA25) counts 0 -> 1 with full points,
# not before the battle is won. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
wait 270
watch u8 0x0213ba12 bealzebub_cards
watch u16 0x020b489a bealzebub_points
watch u8 0x0213ba25 thanatos_cards
watch u16 0x020b48c0 thanatos_points
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
